WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.880
The Harry Potter film series put together a&nbsp;
seriously impressive ensemble of young and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.960
established actors across its eight&nbsp;
films. Here's what happened to many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.800
of your favorites over the years since&nbsp;
the final Harry Potter film released.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:18.720
After a huge search to find a young British actor&nbsp;
to play Harry Potter, producers settled on Daniel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.760
Radcliffe, who was cast in the role at just 11&nbsp;
years old, making him the perfect age to play&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:29.280
Harry as he turns 11 and heads to Hogwarts. A&nbsp;
young hero with an immeasurable burden placed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:34.560
upon his shoulders, Harry grows up constantly&nbsp;
battling his nemesis Voldemort - and Radcliffe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:39.920
who played the part through all eight films, felt&nbsp;
a huge sense of responsibility to his character.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:44.880
Even before the Potter films came to an end,&nbsp;
Radcliffe put in the work to pave a varied career&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:49.920
path for himself to ensure that he wouldn't&nbsp;
be typecast as Harry forever. He made waves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:55.680
in 2007 when he landed the difficult leading&nbsp;
role of Equus on stage in London and New York,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.680 --> 00:01:00.240
and has continued to act in major theater&nbsp;
productions. Since hanging up his wand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:05.200
Radcliffe has also appeared in an eclectic&nbsp;
array of films that includes Kill Your Darlings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:10.240
Swiss Army Man, and Guns Akimbo, as&nbsp;
well as the TBS series Miracle Workers.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:15.520
Before Harry arrives at Hogwarts, he meets a&nbsp;
student who will prove to be one of the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:18.320
important people in his life: Ron Weasley.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:21.040
"Here you go boy, bottoms up."
"What's this?"&nbsp;

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:22.720
"Tonic for the nerves."

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:24.880
Played by Rupert Grint,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:29.920
Ron becomes immediate friends with Harry. Ron&nbsp;
proves to be an invaluable friend and ally.

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:35.360
Chosen from a huge group of candidates, Grint,&nbsp;
similar to Radcliffe, joined the Potter cast at a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:42.000
young age and continued in his role for a decade.&nbsp;
Grint's first post-Potter project came in 2013&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:47.680
in the anti-war film Into the White. That&nbsp;
same year, he appeared in the biopic CBGB;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:53.200
a few years later, he broke into television&nbsp;
with roles in Sick Note and Snatch, the latter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:58.960
of which he executive produced. More recently,&nbsp;
Grint starred in the Apple TV+ series Servant.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:04.720
Ron and Harry have an amazing friendship, but&nbsp;
they'd be absolutely nowhere without their other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:10.080
best friend, Hermione Granger, played by Emma&nbsp;
Watson. The smartest witch of her age, Hermione&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:15.520
has an innate genius and intense work ethic that&nbsp;
helps Harry and Ron out of several different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:20.960
scrapes, and where Ron is concerned, it's more&nbsp;
than a friendship, as the two eventually marry.

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:25.360
Watson joined the franchise as a child,&nbsp;
just like her counterparts, and defined the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:31.360
beloved character for legions of fans. Watson's&nbsp;
post-Potter career has proven quite successful,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:35.520
both as a performer and a public figure;&nbsp;
along with roles in films like The Perks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:40.320
of Being a Wallflower, Bling Ring, and the&nbsp;
live action remake of Beauty and the Beast,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:44.720
Watson serves as a Goodwill Ambassador for&nbsp;
the United Nations and promotes causes like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:50.880
literacy and gender equality. Recently, Watson&nbsp;
appeared in director Greta Gerwig's 2019 take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:56.560
on Little Women, and is still acting, despite&nbsp;
2021 reports that she had quietly retired.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:02.000
The producers of the Potter films brought together&nbsp;
some of the most famous British actors in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:07.520
business. That list included Dame Maggie Smith,&nbsp;
who plays Hogwarts professor Minerva McGonagall,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:11.600
a strict yet fair teacher who also&nbsp;
serves as the head of Gryffindor House.

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:16.240
"It is said to be the home… of a monster."

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:23.200
Smith, who was anointed a Dame by Queen Elizabeth&nbsp;
II in 1990, is one of the most venerated actresses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:28.560
of her era, known for her work in films&nbsp;
like 1969's The Prime of Miss Jean Brodie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:33.440
1978's California Suite, both of&nbsp;
which won her an Academy Award.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:38.080
Her most notable post-Potter film work&nbsp;
comes from The Best Exotic Marigold Hotel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:43.360
and its sequel. You can also catch Smith on the&nbsp;
occasional TV series – she won three Emmy Awards&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:48.560
for her role as the imposing Dowager Countess&nbsp;
on the popular period drama Downton Abbey.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:53.600
The world of Harry Potter is inhabited&nbsp;
by plenty of complex characters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:57.680
but few are as fascinating as Severus&nbsp;
Snape, played by Alan Rickman.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:02.080
"Turn to page three hundred and ninety-four."

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:06.400
As Hogwarts' Potions master who&nbsp;
harbors a serious grudge against Harry,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:11.440
Snape comes off as a pretty typical bad guy&nbsp;
out of the gate. However, as it turns out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:17.040
Snape has secretly given his entire life in&nbsp;
service to Harry, and ultimately winds up a hero.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:20.560
Snape's death is one of the saddest&nbsp;
in the series, and tragically,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:26.080
the world lost Rickman in 2016, not long&nbsp;
after his final turn as the double agent.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:31.196
After gaining international fame for his role as the villain Hans Gruber in the action classic

00:04:31.196 --> 00:04:35.436
Die Hard, Rickman became one of the&nbsp;
most in-demand actors of his era,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.436 --> 00:04:40.956
appearing in films like Sense &amp; Sensibility,&nbsp;
Galaxy Quest, and Love Actually, among others.

00:04:41.916 --> 00:04:46.716
When the Harry Potter film franchisebegan,&nbsp;
legendary Irish actor Richard Harris was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.716 --> 00:04:51.356
the perfect choice to play the wise,&nbsp;
seemingly all-knowing Albus Dumbledore,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.356 --> 00:04:57.116
who serves as the beloved headmaster of Hogwarts&nbsp;
and eventually Harry's mentor and parental figure.

00:04:57.116 --> 00:05:02.156
Sadly, Harris - who made a perfect Dumbledore&nbsp;
- wasn't destined to play the part for very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.156 --> 00:05:07.276
long. A celebrated actor known for&nbsp;
his roles in 1992's western Unforgiven&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.276 --> 00:05:12.636
and the 2000 action drama Gladiator,&nbsp;
Harris passed away in October of 2002,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.636 --> 00:05:16.636
after appearing in Harry Potter and&nbsp;
the Chamber of Secrets that same year.

00:05:17.756 --> 00:05:22.556
In the aftermath of Richard Harris' passing,&nbsp;
another talented Irishman stepped up to take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.556 --> 00:05:28.796
over as Dumbledore: Sir Michael Gambon, who made&nbsp;
his debut in 2003's Harry Potter and the Prisoner&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.796 --> 00:05:33.596
of Azkaban and played the character for the&nbsp;
remainder of the franchise. Gambon's Dumbledore&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.596 --> 00:05:39.196
was a little less gentle than Harris' portrayal -&nbsp;
a particular scene in Goblet of Fire stands out.

00:05:39.196 --> 00:05:42.396
"Did you put your name in&nbsp;
the Goblet of Fire? Did you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.396 --> 00:05:44.556
ask one of the older students to do it for you?"

00:05:44.556 --> 00:05:47.756
But Gambon relished the role,&nbsp;
portraying a man racked with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.756 --> 00:05:52.316
self-doubt and regret internally but&nbsp;
confident and cool on the outside.

00:05:52.316 --> 00:05:57.116
A venerated actor of the stage and screen,&nbsp;
Gambon earned acclaim for his work with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.116 --> 00:06:02.396
the National Theatre, film roles ranging&nbsp;
from 1989's The Cook, the Thief, His Wife,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.396 --> 00:06:09.036
and Her Lover to 2010's The King's Speech, as well&nbsp;
as television projects like 2017's Little Women.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.036 --> 00:06:13.996
He retired from the stage in 2015, but&nbsp;
continues to appear in film and television.

00:06:14.636 --> 00:06:19.916
Early on after discovering the truth about who he&nbsp;
is, Harry meets another young wizard who will be a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.916 --> 00:06:26.476
thorn in his side for years: Draco Malfoy, played&nbsp;
by Tom Felton. A spoiled and pampered bully from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.476 --> 00:06:32.316
a wealthy, high-status family, Draco spends&nbsp;
his time picking on Harry, Ron, and Hermione,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.316 --> 00:06:37.276
usually flanked by goons and hangers-on. By&nbsp;
the time the Battle of Hogwarts is raging,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.276 --> 00:06:42.876
he's fully allied himself with Voldemort and his&nbsp;
Death Eaters, actively working against Harry.

00:06:42.876 --> 00:06:47.996
In the years since Potter, Felton has appeared&nbsp;
in big-budget blockbusters like 2011's Rise of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.996 --> 00:06:53.516
the Planet of the Apes as well as independent&nbsp;
films like 2018's Ophelia. On the small screen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.516 --> 00:06:59.036
you might remember his performance in season&nbsp;
three of the CW's hit Arrowverse series The Flash.

00:06:59.756 --> 00:07:03.276
A shy and bumbling young wizard&nbsp;
when he arrives at Hogwarts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.276 --> 00:07:07.596
Neville Longbottom, played by Matthew&nbsp;
Lewis, has an unassuming beginning.

00:07:07.596 --> 00:07:11.116
"Has anyone seen a toad? A&nbsp;
boy named Neville's lost one."

00:07:11.676 --> 00:07:17.276
However, during his time at Hogwarts, he grows&nbsp;
into a determined and strong young wizard. By the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.276 --> 00:07:23.276
final films, Neville is leading the renegade group&nbsp;
Dumbledore's Army at Hogwarts to fight Voldemort,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.276 --> 00:07:27.756
and plays a crucial role in the Battle&nbsp;
of Hogwarts to take down the Dark Lord.

00:07:27.756 --> 00:07:31.036
Lewis, like his character, has&nbsp;
experienced a pretty dramatic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.036 --> 00:07:34.956
glow up and has turned into a bona&nbsp;
fide leading man over the years.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.956 --> 00:07:38.396
As a result, he's racked up plenty&nbsp;
of film roles throughout his career,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.396 --> 00:07:44.476
including in 2016's Me Before You and 2018's&nbsp;
Terminal, as well as some television appearances.

00:07:45.356 --> 00:07:49.276
Briefly introduced in the first film&nbsp;
but fleshed out in Chamber of Secrets,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.276 --> 00:07:53.356
Ron's normally vivacious and bright&nbsp;
younger sister, Ginny Weasley,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.356 --> 00:07:58.076
is played by Bonnie Wright. She's rendered&nbsp;
more or less mute when she meets Harry,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.076 --> 00:08:03.596
on whom she has an enormous crush. Not only do the&nbsp;
two eventually strike up a romantic relationship&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.596 --> 00:08:08.956
in Half-Blood Prince, they get married and start&nbsp;
a family after Harry finally defeats Voldemort.

00:08:08.956 --> 00:08:13.276
Since Potter, Wright has continued working&nbsp;
as an actor on the stage and screen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.276 --> 00:08:17.996
but she has tended to focus more on production and&nbsp;
direction. She has been responsible for bringing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.996 --> 00:08:23.356
several films to screen, including Separate&nbsp;
We Come, Separate We Go and Medusa's Ankles.

00:08:24.076 --> 00:08:28.396
Harry and his friends don't meet Evanna&nbsp;
Lynch's Luna Lovegood until Harry Potter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.396 --> 00:08:31.836
and the Order of the Phoenix, but she&nbsp;
certainly makes quite an impression.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.836 --> 00:08:35.836
Luna becomes close with Harry,&nbsp;
Ron, Hermione, Neville and Ginny,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.836 --> 00:08:40.236
with their bond intensifying after the&nbsp;
group takes on Death Eaters together.

00:08:40.236 --> 00:08:43.516
"Hungry. I hope there's pudding."

00:08:44.236 --> 00:08:48.636
Lynch, a longtime Potter fan who&nbsp;
was a devotee of the book series,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.636 --> 00:08:53.836
was deemed "perfect" for the part by producers&nbsp;
after an open audition and continued to play&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.836 --> 00:08:58.236
the role until the franchise ended. When it&nbsp;
did, Lynch stayed in the public eye but took&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.236 --> 00:09:03.596
on fewer projects, signing on for roles like&nbsp;
2015's My Name is Emily while taking breaks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.596 --> 00:09:08.316
from acting to focus on her environmentally&nbsp;
friendly makeup line, Kinder Beauty Box.

00:09:09.196 --> 00:09:12.396
One of the most accomplished and&nbsp;
versatile actors working today,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.396 --> 00:09:18.396
Helena Bonham Carter was the ideal choice to play&nbsp;
the savage, cruel Death Eater Bellatrix Lestrange,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.396 --> 00:09:21.356
whose devotion to Voldemort&nbsp;
borders on the inappropriate.

00:09:21.356 --> 00:09:26.636
"I killed Sirius Black,&nbsp;
hahahaha. You coming to get me?"

00:09:26.636 --> 00:09:30.556
Throughout her long and impressive&nbsp;
career, Bonham Carter has ping-ponged&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.556 --> 00:09:36.876
between period pieces like 1992's Howards&nbsp;
End, huge hits like 1999's Fight Club,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.876 --> 00:09:42.956
and fantastical collaborations with former&nbsp;
partner Tim Burton like 2007's Sweeney Todd.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.956 --> 00:09:48.716
Bonham Carter has worked steadily for years, but&nbsp;
one of her highest profile roles came in 2019,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.716 --> 00:09:53.196
where she took on the role of the hard-partying&nbsp;
Princess Margaret on Netflix's The Crown.

00:09:53.916 --> 00:09:57.996
Voldemort doesn't truly appear in the flesh&nbsp;
for the first three Harry Potter films,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.996 --> 00:10:02.796
as he hasn't yet regained human form, but&nbsp;
thanks to some loyal servants and dark magic,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.796 --> 00:10:09.116
he returns to his full strength in Goblet of Fire&nbsp;
at the film's climax, played by Ralph Fiennes.

00:10:09.116 --> 00:10:13.116
It might seem crazy that Jennifer&nbsp;
Lopez's love interest in the 2002&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.116 --> 00:10:17.676
romantic comedy Maid in Manhattan would&nbsp;
go on to play the Dark Lord Voldemort,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.676 --> 00:10:22.156
but Fiennes has some serious range. On&nbsp;
the heels of Voldemort, Fiennes appeared&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.156 --> 00:10:28.796
in the 2012 James Bond film Skyfall as Gareth&nbsp;
Mallory, and later reprised the role. In 2014,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.796 --> 00:10:33.276
he earned acclaim for a starring role&nbsp;
in Wes Anderson's Grand Budapest Hotel.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.276 --> 00:10:38.236
Recently, Fiennes starred alongside Carey&nbsp;
Mulligan in the Netflix original film The Dig.

00:10:39.116 --> 00:10:43.836
When it came time to cast the bombastic,&nbsp;
over-the-top author and Hogwarts professor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.836 --> 00:10:48.636
Gilderoy Lockhart, who makes his debut in&nbsp;
Chamber of Secrets, there could be no other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.636 --> 00:10:53.516
choice than Kenneth Branagh. When Lockhart takes&nbsp;
over the position of Professor of Defense Against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.516 --> 00:10:58.716
the Dark Arts, he's quickly revealed to be&nbsp;
completely inept, despite his enormous ego.

00:10:58.716 --> 00:11:04.156
An award-nominated actor who trained at and&nbsp;
now leads the Royal Academy of Dramatic Art,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.156 --> 00:11:09.356
Branagh is a legend of the stage and the screen,&nbsp;
well known for adaptations of Shakespeare.

00:11:09.356 --> 00:11:15.836
"Upon Saint Crispin's Day!" YAAAAAY!

00:11:15.836 --> 00:11:19.436
An accomplished director in addition&nbsp;
to his work in front of the camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.436 --> 00:11:22.316
Branagh has made time to helm&nbsp;
projects like the first Thor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.316 --> 00:11:27.596
film while continuing to appear in films&nbsp;
like 2017's Dunkirk and 2020's Tenet.

00:11:28.556 --> 00:11:34.076
Some actors only appear in a single Potter movie,&nbsp;
but while David Tennant only popped up in Goblet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:34.076 --> 00:11:39.596
of Fire, he certainly makes an impression as the&nbsp;
briefly seen but utterly disturbing Barty Crouch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.596 --> 00:11:45.436
Jr., a devoted follower of Voldemort. Crouch&nbsp;
Jr. is disguised for most of the film as Mad-Eye&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.436 --> 00:11:51.196
Moody, posing as the Defense Against the Dark&nbsp;
Arts teacher until his disguise finally cracks.

00:11:51.196 --> 00:11:56.796
By the time he appeared in Goblet of Fire,&nbsp;
Tennant was already playing Doctor Who on the BBC.

00:11:56.796 --> 00:11:59.262
Afterward, Tennant changed tack with the

00:11:59.262 --> 00:12:04.942
gritty British crime drama Broadchurch, opposite&nbsp;
Olivia Colman. Marvel fans likely remember Tennant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.942 --> 00:12:09.742
from his terrifying turn as Kilgrave in&nbsp;
Netflix's Marvel series Jessica Jones.

00:12:09.742 --> 00:12:17.662
"Cut your heart out dad. Put&nbsp;
a bullet in your skull Patsy."

00:12:17.662 --> 00:12:21.022
He's also appeared in some recent&nbsp;
high-profile film projects,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:21.022 --> 00:12:23.582
including 2018's Mary Queen of Scots.

00:12:24.382 --> 00:12:29.582
Thanks to a curse inflicted by Voldemort, the post&nbsp;
of Defense Against the Dark Arts ends up with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.582 --> 00:12:35.342
new professor in the role every year. During his&nbsp;
third year, the seat was occupied by Remus Lupin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:35.342 --> 00:12:40.302
played by David Thewlis]. Though Lupin remains&nbsp;
tight-lipped about his personal life at first,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:40.302 --> 00:12:44.942
our heroes eventually uncover that he's a&nbsp;
werewolf. Lupin is forced out of the job,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:44.942 --> 00:12:48.382
but he remains committed to helping&nbsp;
fight against the rising darkness.

00:12:48.382 --> 00:12:52.462
When it comes to non-Potter projects,&nbsp;
Thewlis has kept busy over the years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:52.462 --> 00:12:57.742
appearing in big films like 2011's War&nbsp;
Horse, 2014's The Theory of Everything,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:57.742 --> 00:13:02.062
the 2017 blockbuster Wonder&nbsp;
Woman as Ares. More recently,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:02.062 --> 00:13:06.462
you may have caught Thewlis in the 2020&nbsp;
Netflix film I'm Thinking of Ending Things.

00:13:07.662 --> 00:13:11.342
We first see Brendan Gleeson, who&nbsp;
plays Alastor "Mad-Eye" Moody,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:11.342 --> 00:13:17.262
he's not who he seems - literally, as he's being&nbsp;
impersonated by Death Eater Barty Crouch Jr.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:17.262 --> 00:13:21.342
Audiences finally get to meet him as&nbsp;
his true self in Order of the Phoenix,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:21.342 --> 00:13:25.902
but when he appears in Deathly Hallows,&nbsp;
tragically, it's his final appearance.

00:13:25.902 --> 00:13:30.142
By the time he appeared in the Potter films,&nbsp;
Gleeson was already well known for his roles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:30.142 --> 00:13:37.262
in huge movies like 1995's Braveheart and 2002's&nbsp;
Gangs of New York. After the film franchise ended,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:37.262 --> 00:13:43.742
you may have caught him in 2014's Edge of Tomorrow&nbsp;
or the delightful 2017 comedy Paddington 2.

00:13:43.742 --> 00:13:46.142
"All right we'll have time for&nbsp;
the cozy catch up later. We've&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:46.142 --> 00:13:49.063
got to get the hell out of here, soon."

00:13:49.422 --> 00:13:52.702
There are plenty of family connections&nbsp;
within the cast of Harry Potter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:52.702 --> 00:13:56.862
but casual fans might not know that&nbsp;
the actor who portrays Bill Weasley,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:56.862 --> 00:14:01.422
Domhnall Gleeson, is the son of&nbsp;
Mad-Eye Moody himself, Brendan Gleeson.

00:14:01.422 --> 00:14:04.302
Immediately after his brief&nbsp;
turn in the Potter franchise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:04.302 --> 00:14:09.662
Gleeson appeared in leading roles in 2012's&nbsp;
Anna Karenina adaptation and Richard Curtis'&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:09.662 --> 00:14:16.142
sweet 2013 romantic comedy About Time. 2015 was&nbsp;
a pivotal role for this talented young actor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:16.142 --> 00:14:20.782
who appeared in the sci-fi thriller Ex Machina&nbsp;
and also made his debut in the Star Wars&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:20.782 --> 00:14:26.302
sequel trilogy in The Force Awakens. He's also&nbsp;
appeared in films like mother! and Peter Rabbit.

00:14:27.022 --> 00:14:31.982
In Harry's third year at Hogwarts, he and his&nbsp;
classmates are introduced to Divination lessons,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:31.982 --> 00:14:35.342
a course led by the whifty,&nbsp;
unreliable Professor Trelawney,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:35.342 --> 00:14:40.622
played by Emma Thompson. While her confidence in&nbsp;
her own skills doesn't exactly match her output,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:40.622 --> 00:14:46.222
she once made a very real prediction: the one that&nbsp;
settles both Harry and Voldemort's awful fate.

00:14:46.222 --> 00:14:51.022
Emma Thompson, one of the most well-known&nbsp;
and influential British actors of her time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:51.022 --> 00:14:56.222
plays the silly Trelawney to perfection,&nbsp;
almost unrecognizable in enormous glasses and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:56.222 --> 00:15:00.622
piles of shawls. She has appeared in a&nbsp;
huge variety of different projects since,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:00.622 --> 00:15:07.022
including 2013's Saving Mr. Banks, 2017's&nbsp;
Beauty and the Beast and 2019's Late Night.

00:15:07.582 --> 00:15:09.102
"You know what, I'm not&nbsp;
gonna remember any of this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:09.102 --> 00:15:13.742
so here's what we're gonna do.&nbsp;
Um, you're one. Two. Three."

00:15:13.742 --> 00:15:18.062
When Harry first learns about Sirius Black,&nbsp;
played by Gary Oldman, he believes that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:18.062 --> 00:15:24.142
man wanted by the entire wizarding community is a&nbsp;
murderer who killed 13 people with a single curse.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:24.142 --> 00:15:28.702
However, as Harry gets to know the man who&nbsp;
turns out to be his godfather, he realizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:28.702 --> 00:15:33.982
that not only has Sirius been falsely accused&nbsp;
of his crimes, but he's a kind and generous man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:33.982 --> 00:15:38.622
which makes it all the more tragic when he's&nbsp;
killed in front of Harry in Order of the Phoenix.

00:15:38.622 --> 00:15:42.302
Gary Oldman was already an&nbsp;
enormous star before Harry Potter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:42.302 --> 00:15:46.702
thanks to high-profile roles in films&nbsp;
like The Fifth Element and Air Force One,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:46.702 --> 00:15:52.542
among many others. After competing for an&nbsp;
Oscar in 2011 for Tinker Tailor Soldier Spy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:52.542 --> 00:15:58.062
the veteran finally won one in 2017 for his&nbsp;
portrayal of Winston Churchill in Darkest Hour.

00:15:58.782 --> 00:16:04.302
Voldemort may be the biggest bad in Harry Potter,&nbsp;
but Dolores Umbridge, played by Imelda Staunton,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:04.302 --> 00:16:09.182
gives him a run for his money. A devoted Ministry&nbsp;
employee desperate to rise within the ranks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:09.182 --> 00:16:14.382
Umbridge ends up placed at Hogwarts to keep an&nbsp;
eye on Dumbledore and his supposed wrongdoings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:14.382 --> 00:16:17.422
eventually succeeding him&nbsp;
and becoming headmistress.

00:16:17.422 --> 00:16:23.022
"So silly of me, but it sounds as if you're&nbsp;
questioning my authority in my own classroom."

00:16:23.022 --> 00:16:27.022
Staunton was well known pre-Potter&nbsp;
thanks to roles in the 1998 Best&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:27.022 --> 00:16:32.462
Picture winner Shakespeare in Love and&nbsp;
2005's Nanny McPhee, among many others.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:32.462 --> 00:16:36.462
After her time in the Potter films came&nbsp;
to a close, you may have heard Staunton&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:36.462 --> 00:16:42.462
in the Paddington films or seen her as a fairy in&nbsp;
Maleficent: Mistress of Evil with Angelina Jolie.

00:16:43.182 --> 00:16:48.542
Harry is bullied a lot in the series, and&nbsp;
one of his first true enemies is his cousin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:48.542 --> 00:16:54.542
Dudley Dursley. Played by Harry Melling, Dudley is&nbsp;
a spoiled child who's given anything he wants by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:54.542 --> 00:16:59.822
his indulgent parents, and is a true terror for&nbsp;
much of his life - though in the books and in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:59.822 --> 00:17:05.502
deleted scene from Deathly Hallows: Part 1, Dudley&nbsp;
does show remorse for his behavior towards Harry.

00:17:05.502 --> 00:17:10.542
In the years that followed, Melling shed the&nbsp;
image of Dudley and worked on several high-profile&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:10.542 --> 00:17:16.382
projects. From 2018 to 2020, Melling appeared&nbsp;
in three popular Netflix films - The Ballad of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:16.382 --> 00:17:22.062
Buster Scruggs, The Devil All the Time, and The&nbsp;
Old Guard. But you might know him best from his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:22.062 --> 00:17:27.182
scene-stealing supporting role in the beloved&nbsp;
2020 Netflix miniseries The Queen's Gambit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:27.182 --> 00:17:31.422
in which his character lends his love&nbsp;
and support to chess prodigy Beth Harmon.

00:17:32.302 --> 00:17:37.262
Petunia Dursley, played by Fiona Shaw, forces&nbsp;
her nephew Harry to sleep in a cupboard&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:37.262 --> 00:17:43.182
under the stairs and generally abuses him until he&nbsp;
finally learns the truth about his magical blood.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:43.182 --> 00:17:48.062
After that revelation, the Dursleys avoid&nbsp;
and marginalize him as much as possible,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:48.062 --> 00:17:51.182
never truly acknowledging him&nbsp;
as a real member of the family.

00:17:51.182 --> 00:17:56.222
Fiona Shaw was a legend of the British stage&nbsp;
before she took on the role of Petunia Dursley,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:56.222 --> 00:17:59.902
and she continued working steadily&nbsp;
after her Potter years ended.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:59.902 --> 00:18:04.622
Recently, Shaw appeared in films like&nbsp;
2020's Enola Holmes, and also found&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:04.622 --> 00:18:09.902
time for television roles in popular shows&nbsp;
like Killing Eve, Fleabag, and True Blood.

